---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/page-layouts.css';
---

<Layout
title="About — Mike Trounce"
description="A bit of background on Mike Trounce — ten years in specialist financial data before becoming a General Manager for early and growth-stage businesses."
>
<div class="options-page">
<a href="/" class="back-link">&larr; Mike Trounce</a>

<h1>About</h1>

<section class="content-section">
<h2>Before this</h2>
<p>
I spent ten years in specialist financial data. Trounceflow (2016–2023) was scrapers, a Postgres database and a chart-driven site tracking who holds emerging-market government bonds. Delphos IQ (2022–2023) was separate work on development finance — how capital moves around the world for development. Exante Data acquired Trounceflow in 2023, rebuilt the site, and I ran the product as FlowPro from 2023 until this year.
</p>
<p>
<a href="/michael-trounce-cv.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Full CV (PDF) &rarr;</a>
</p>
</section>

<section class="content-section">
<h2>A quick introduction</h2>
<div class="intro-video">
<video controls preload="metadata" poster="/media/mike-intro-poster.jpg" playsinline>
<source src="/media/mike-intro.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
</video>
</div>
</section>

<section class="content-section">
<h2>Where else to find me</h2>
<p>
<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/michael-trounce/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a> for the career history above, in its usual format. <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@michaeltrounce3746" target="_blank" rel="noopener">YouTube</a> for video. Instagram and X to follow once there's something worth posting there.
</p>
</section>
</div>
</Layout>

<style>
.intro-video {
width: 100%;
